------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components linked into the compiled binary
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project builds on established open-source transports rather than
reimplementing them. The brain never calls these libraries to decide anything;
they are dialled as interchangeable "wires". The components below are retrieved
by the Go module system at their pinned versions (see go.sum) and linked into
the binary. Each remains under its own license.

Transports and TLS:
