                                                    WebSocket, XHTTP and gRPC transport
  github.com/xtls/reality                MPL-2.0   REALITY handshake
  github.com/refraction-networking/utls  BSD-3     TLS ClientHello fingerprints
  github.com/apernet/hysteria/core/v2    MIT       Hysteria 2 client
  github.com/apernet/hysteria/extras/v2  MIT       Salamander obfuscation
  github.com/apernet/quic-go             MIT       QUIC
  github.com/quic-go/qpack               MIT       QPACK for QUIC
